{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every vertex B-connected to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" included, in vertex-index order: Gallo et"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"al.‘s B-Visit (halp’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"b_visit"},{"type":"text","text":"). A hyperedge fires once every one of its sources has been"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reached, and then reaches all its targets. On a directed graph read as a hypergraph this is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reachability."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph"]]},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP11HypergraphsE18bConnectedVertices4fromSay6VertexQzGAH_tF","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Hypergraphs"}],"title":"bConnectedVertices(from:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bConnectedVertices","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"DirectedHypergraphAlgorithms.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Hypergr